	)
	(text "J14 mates with carrier J15/J18: GND / selected logic 5 V / SDA / SCL / SYNC / raw actuator 5 V.\nJ17 is the separate mains feed. USB can power logic without powering relay/opto actuators.\nOnly one new/recovery board at the selected default address; other addressed boards may remain connected."
